# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AVOXAN — Cloudflare Pages redirects
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pages auto-serves .html files at their bare path, so both
# /contact.html AND /contact work. To prevent Google from
# indexing both as duplicates, we 301 every .html URL to the
# extensionless canonical version.
#
# Format: <source> <destination> <status>
# Pages reads top-to-bottom; first match wins.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Top-level pages
/services.html        /services        301
/pricing.html         /pricing         301
/process.html         /process         301
/faq.html             /faq             301
/contact.html         /contact         301
/index.html           /                301

# ── Case studies
