/work/brightside-family-dental.html       /work/brightside-family-dental 301
/work/marin-ashby-studio.html             /work/marin-ashby-studio       301
/work/avery-reyes-law-group.html          /work/avery-reyes-law-group    301
/work/avoxan-studio-site.html             /work/avoxan-studio-site       301

